## Technical Details
- **`CanvasState`**: Split `beatStartTime` and `beatDuration` from generic animation needs.
- **`startRenderLoop`**: Now continues running as long as a transition is active or any object is in `activeAnimations`.
- **`interpolateObjects`**: Added comprehensive lerping for `lerpColor`, `lerpArr`, and recursive property updates.

The MathViz engine is now ready for high-quality mathematical storytelling!
